<title>USA: Thermo Voltek Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Thermo Voltek Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>		 Dec. 28,     Dec. 30,     Dec. 28,     Dec. 30,</p>
<p>		  1996	   1995	   1996	   1995</p>
<p>Revenues   $13,204,000  $11,022,000  $48,507,000  $36,326,000</p>
<p>Income Before Provision for Income Taxes:</p>
<p>		 1,570,000    1,155,000    6,009,000    3,364,000</p>
<p>Net Income   1,206,000	910,000    4,469,000    2,672,000</p>
<p>Earnings per Share:</p>
<p>			.13	    .12	    .51	    .40</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares:</p>
<p>		 9,625,000    7,490,000    8,827,000    6,731,000</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Thermo Voltek Corp, a public subsidiary of Thermedics Inc, which is a Thermo Electron company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
